'''Maces''' are a category containing two melee [[weapon]] [[item class]]es; [[One Hand Maces]] and [[Two Hand Maces]].

[[One Hand Maces]] and [[Two Hand Maces]] maces require [[strength]] to equip, and provide increased [[stun]] duration on enemies as an implicit [[modifier]].

